  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A precise, full-coverage concealer with serum-strength actives and an airy matte finish that visibly brightens dark circles and firms.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Full</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Matte</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong></p><p >- Vital Wakeup Complex (Gentian Root, Coffee Leaf Extract, Licorice Root): Brightens the look of dark circles, targets hyperpigmentation, and visibly lifts and firms eye contour.</p><p>- Peptides: Support natural collagen and softens crepiness, fine lines, and crow’s feet.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p >-Start with well-hydrated skin.</p><p>-Make sure your eye serum has fully absorbed for a seamless finish.</p><p>-Apply a tiny dot sparingly where needed—a little goes a long way.</p><p>-To brighten under eyes, dot or dash near the inner corner.</p><p>-To spot conceal, dot directly onto any redness or hyperpigmentation.</p><p>-Tap gently with a dabbing motion to blend, using your ring finger or a brush. Gucci recommends the Westman Atelier Baby Blender Brush (sold separately).</p><p>-When choosing your shade, make sure to blend out formula and allow the color to fully set.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Gentian Root, Coffee Leaf Extract, and Licorice Root: Visibly brighten dark circles and hyperpigmentation and lift and firm the look of the eye contour.<br>-Mini Hyaluronic Acid: Features a low molecular weight for optimal absorption; hydrates, and visibly firms and smooths. <br>-Peptides: Support natural collagen and soften the look of crepiness, fine lines, and crow&rsquo;s feet. <br><br>Water (Aqua), C9-12 Alkane, Octyldodecyl Neopentanoate, Glycerin, Diisostearoyl Polyglyceryl-3 Dimer Dilinoleate, Sodium Potassium Aluminum Silicate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Tribehenin, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Gentiana Lutea Root Extract, Coffea Arabica (Coffee) Seed Extract, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Disodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Sodium Chloride, Caprylyl Glycol, Propylene Carbonate, Potassium Sorbate, Silica, Propanediol, Aluminum Hydroxide, Citric Acid, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-) : Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Bismuth Oxychloride (Ci 77163).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A precise, full-coverage concealer with serum-strength actives and an airy matte finish that visibly brightens dark circles and firms.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Full</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Matte</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong></p><p >- Vital Wakeup Complex (Gentian Root, Coffee Leaf Extract, Licorice Root): Brightens the look of dark circles, targets hyperpigmentation, and visibly lifts and firms eye contour.</p><p>- Peptides: Support natural collagen and softens crepiness, fine lines, and crow’s feet.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p >-Start with well-hydrated skin.</p><p>-Make sure your eye serum has fully absorbed for a seamless finish.</p><p>-Apply a tiny dot sparingly where needed—a little goes a long way.</p><p>-To brighten under eyes, dot or dash near the inner corner.</p><p>-To spot conceal, dot directly onto any redness or hyperpigmentation.</p><p>-Tap gently with a dabbing motion to blend, using your ring finger or a brush. Gucci recommends the Westman Atelier Baby Blender Brush (sold separately).</p><p>-When choosing your shade, make sure to blend out formula and allow the color to fully set.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Gentian Root, Coffee Leaf Extract, and Licorice Root: Visibly brighten dark circles and hyperpigmentation and lift and firm the look of the eye contour.<br>-Mini Hyaluronic Acid: Features a low molecular weight for optimal absorption; hydrates, and visibly firms and smooths. <br>-Peptides: Support natural collagen and soften the look of crepiness, fine lines, and crow&rsquo;s feet. <br><br>Water (Aqua), C9-12 Alkane, Octyldodecyl Neopentanoate, Glycerin, Diisostearoyl Polyglyceryl-3 Dimer Dilinoleate, Sodium Potassium Aluminum Silicate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Tribehenin, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Gentiana Lutea Root Extract, Coffea Arabica (Coffee) Seed Extract, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Disodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Sodium Chloride, Caprylyl Glycol, Propylene Carbonate, Potassium Sorbate, Silica, Propanediol, Aluminum Hydroxide, Citric Acid, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-) : Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Bismuth Oxychloride (Ci 77163).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
